{
    "'{0}' is already in your favourites": "“{0}”已在收藏夹中",
    "<p>Baking causes CyberChef to run the Recipe against your data. This involves three steps:</p><ol><li>The data in the Input is encoded into bytes using the character encoding selected in the Input status bar.</li><li>The data is run through each of the operations in the Recipe in turn with the output of one operation being fed into the next operation as its input.</li><li>The outcome of the final operation in the Recipe is decoded into Output text using the character encoding selected in the Output status bar.</li></ol><p>If there are multiple Inputs, the Bake button causes every Input to be baked simultaneously.</p>": "<p>烘焙会让 CyberChef 用配方处理你的数据，分为三步：</p><ol><li>使用输入状态栏中选定的字符编码，把输入中的数据编码为字节。</li><li>数据依次经过配方中的每个操作，前一个操作的输出作为下一个操作的输入。</li><li>使用输出状态栏中选定的字符编码，把最后一个操作的结果解码为输出文本。</li></ol><p>如果有多个输入，点击“烘焙”按钮会同时处理所有输入。</p>",
    "<p>Recipes can be represented in a few different formats and saved for use at a later date. You can either copy the Recipe configuration and save it somewhere offline for later use, or use your browser's local storage.</p><ul><li><b>Deep link:</b> The easiest way to share a CyberChef Recipe is to copy the deep link, either from the address bar (which is updated as the Recipe or Input changes), or from the 'Save recipe' pane. When you visit this link, the Recipe and Input will be populated from where you left off.</li><li><b>Chef format:</b> This custom format is designed to be compact and easily readable. It is the format used in CyberChef's URL, so it largely uses characters that do not have to be escaped in URL encoding, making it a little easier to understand what a CyberChef URL contains.</li><li><b>Clean JSON:</b> This JSON format uses whitespace and indentation in a way that makes the Recipe easy to read.</li><li><b>Compact JSON:</b> This is the most compact way that the Recipe can be represented in JSON.</li><li><b>Local storage:</b> Alternatively, you can enter a name into the 'Recipe name' field and save to your browser's local storage. The Recipe will then be available to load from the 'Load Recipe' pane as long as you are using the same browser profile. Be aware that if your browser profile is cleaned, you may lose this data.</li></ul>": "<p>配方可以用几种不同的格式表示并保存，以便日后使用。你可以复制配方配置并离线保存，也可以保存到浏览器的本地存储中。</p><ul><li><b>深度链接：</b>分享 CyberChef 配方最简单的方法是复制深度链接，可以从地址栏（会随配方或输入的变化而更新）或“保存配方”窗格中复制。打开该链接时，配方和输入会恢复到你离开时的状态。</li><li><b>Chef 格式：</b>这种自定义格式紧凑易读，也是 CyberChef URL 使用的格式，主要使用无需 URL 编码转义的字符，便于看懂 URL 中的内容。</li><li><b>整洁 JSON：</b>使用空白和缩进，使配方易于阅读。</li><li><b>紧凑 JSON：</b>以最紧凑的 JSON 形式表示配方。</li><li><b>本地存储：</b>也可以在“配方名称”栏中输入名称，保存到浏览器的本地存储。只要使用同一个浏览器配置文件，就可以在“加载配方”窗格中加载。注意：清理浏览器配置文件可能导致这些数据丢失。</li></ul>",
    "<p>Saved recipes can be loaded using one of the following methods:</p><ul><li>If you have a CyberChef deep link, simply visit that link and the Recipe and Input will be populated automatically.</li><li>If you have a Recipe string in any of the accepted formats, paste it into the 'Load recipe' pane textbox and click 'Load'.</li><li>If you have saved a Recipe to your browser's local storage, it should be available in the dropdown menu in the 'Load recipe' pane. If it is not there, you may not be using the same browser profile, or your profile may have been cleared.</li></ul>": "<p>可以通过以下方式加载已保存的配方：</p><ul><li>如果有 CyberChef 深度链接，直接打开该链接，配方和输入会自动填充。</li><li>如果有任意支持格式的配方字符串，把它粘贴到“加载配方”窗格的文本框中，然后点击“加载”。</li><li>如果把配方保存在了浏览器的本地存储中，可以在“加载配方”窗格的下拉菜单中找到它。如果找不到，可能是使用了不同的浏览器配置文件，或者配置文件已被清理。</li></ul>",
    "<p>The Operations list contains all the operations in CyberChef arranged into categories. Some operations may be present in multiple categories. You can search for operations using the search box.</p><p>To use an operation, either double click it, or drag it into the Recipe pane. You will then be able to configure its arguments (or 'Ingredients' in CyberChef terminology).</p>": "<p>操作列表按分类列出了 CyberChef 中的所有操作，部分操作可能同时出现在多个分类中。可以使用搜索框搜索操作。</p><p>要使用某个操作，可以双击它，或者把它拖到配方窗格中，然后就可以配置它的参数（CyberChef 术语中称为“配料”）。</p>",
    "<p>The Recipe pane is where your chosen Operations are configured. If you are a programmer, think of these as functions. If you are not a programmer, these are like steps in a cake recipe. The Input data will be processed based on the Operations in your Recipe.</p><ul><li>To reorder, simply drag and drop the Operations into the order your require</li><li>To remove an operation, either double click it, or drag it outside of the Recipe pane</li></ul><p>The arguments (or 'Ingredients' in CyberChef terminology) can be configured to change how an Operation processes the data.</p>": "<p>配方窗格用于配置你选择的操作。如果你是程序员，可以把它们看作函数；如果不是，可以把它们看作做蛋糕的步骤。输入数据会按照配方中的操作依次处理。</p><ul><li>重新排序：直接拖放操作即可调整顺序</li><li>删除操作：双击该操作，或把它拖出配方窗格</li></ul><p>可以修改参数（CyberChef 术语中称为“配料”）来改变操作处理数据的方式。</p>",
    "<p>The Step button allows you to execute one operation at a time, rather than running the whole Recipe from beginning to end.</p><p>Step allows you to inspect the data at each stage of the Recipe and understand what is being passed to the next operation.</p>": "<p>“单步”按钮每次只执行一个操作，而不是从头到尾执行整个配方。</p><p>单步执行可以查看每个阶段的数据，了解传递给下一个操作的内容。</p>",
    "<p>Use the search box to find useful operations.</p><p>Both operation names and descriptions are queried using a fuzzy matching algorithm.</p>": "<p>使用搜索框查找需要的操作。</p><p>操作名称（中英文均可）和说明都会通过模糊匹配算法进行查询。</p>",
    "<p>When Auto-bake is turned on, CyberChef will bake the Input using the Recipe whenever anything in the Input or Recipe changes.</p>This includes:<ul><li>Adding or removing operations</li><li>Modifying operation arguments</li><li>Editing the Input</li><li>Changing the Input character encoding</li></ul><p>If there are multiple inputs, only the currently active tab will be baked when Auto-bake triggers. You can bake all inputs manually using the Bake button.</p>": "<p>开启自动烘焙后，只要输入或配方发生任何变化，CyberChef 就会用配方处理输入。</p>包括：<ul><li>添加或删除操作</li><li>修改操作参数</li><li>编辑输入</li><li>更改输入的字符编码</li></ul><p>如果有多个输入，自动烘焙只会处理当前活动的标签页。可以使用“烘焙”按钮手动处理所有输入。</p>",
