    "Clicking 'Hide arguments' will hide all the argument views for every Operation in the Recipe, to save space when you have too many Operation in your Recipe": "点击“隐藏参数”会隐藏配方中所有操作的参数视图，在配方中操作较多时可以节省空间",
    "Clicking the 'Clear input and output' button will remove all Inputs and Outputs. It will not clear the Recipe.": "点击“清空输入和输出”按钮会删除所有输入和输出，但不会清空配方。",
    "Clicking the 'Clear recipe' button will remove all operations from the Recipe. It will not clear the Input, but it will trigger a Bake if Auto-bake is turned on, which will change the value of the Output.": "点击“清空配方”按钮会删除配方中的所有操作。它不会清空输入，但如果开启了自动烘焙，会触发一次烘焙，从而改变输出。",
    "Configurable options to change how CyberChef behaves. These settings are stored in your browser's local storage, meaning they will persist between sessions that use the same browser profile.": "用于调整 CyberChef 行为的可配置选项。这些设置保存在浏览器的本地存储中，使用同一个浏览器配置文件时会在会话之间保留。",
